[{"title":"初至玉阳二首 其二","author":"区怀瑞","text":"生平厌嚣杂，开径远尘轨。\n洗耳田舍谋，因之枕秋水。\n今来弹丸邑，乃仅三家市。\n赤手披荆榛，极目伤兰芷。\n下车访遗老，无复旧冠履。\n去者惊风鹤，留者忧蛇豕。\n登陴再三叹，时寄漫悲喜。\n盘桓以居贞，鼎颠而出否。\n卫文大帛冠，齐公亦衣紫。\n民物属维新，请于先甲始。\n休息在靡争，当使疮痍起。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34028,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送留守张参军还武林二首 其一","author":"区怀瑞","text":"玉阳披荆榛，楚熸馀秦氛。\n作始赖君子，云雷为经纶。\n绥此沮与漳，寒壑回青春。\n千秋杜元凯，陵谷有贞珉。\n矫矫东南笴，饮羽荆山珍。\n寸筠倘不易，遗直在斯民。\n徘徊望轨辙，肝胆徒酸辛。\n纻衣惭古谊，捐佩感骚人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34029,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送留守张参军还武林二首 其二","author":"区怀瑞","text":"出入石城隅，周旋每无极。\n兰心动倾盖，何必在畴昔。\n子佐玉麟符，文采生胸臆。\n而我罗浮鸟，卑栖今枳棘。\n南望琅玕实，饥至不遑食。\n濯缨汉水滨，莫附差池翼。\n去去纫荷裳，服之有馀适。\n相期明圣湖，一浣风尘色。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34030,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出唐安寺寻蒙惠二泉","author":"区怀瑞","text":"山桃吐火柳含烟，二月桥光更可怜。\n翠幕不遮江汉女，银罂争挈惠蒙泉。\n空闻桂楫沧浪咏，实少莼丝罨画船。\n乞与军持那得尽，只应饮马过流年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34031,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陆象山祠泉亭　用南充黄太史韵","author":"区怀瑞","text":"一年长溷马牛群，暂喜泉声到夜分。\n解佩未酬汉浦月，搴帷犹忆玉山云。\n石边主静称夫子，溪上题诗识使君。\n对此令人重今昔，只馀千载碧氤氲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34032,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"群寇出栈背抚","author":"区怀瑞","text":"皇穹奖祸乱，猰貐日暴怒。\n关河苦躏蹂，晋楚交驰骛。\n分陕六月师，节钺称车辅。\n擎云抗双阙，杞国忧倾什。\n君子猿鹤化，小人沙虫怖。\n从来蜀道难，寇已遵大路。\n沸釜鱼复间，出之若脱兔。\n巫娥讵蔽亏，青神更阿护。\n剑阁岂不险，人谋匪其故。\n国恩徒浩荡，威克终难悟。\n走圹谁复羁，假息于朝露。\n干羽在两阶，惭愧邯郸步。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34033,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寇燬中都二首 其一","author":"区怀瑞","text":"羽卫园陵外，千秋松桧阴。\n积薪元不戒，急燧远相侵。\n瘗玉涂山古，沉珠淮水深。\n九重哀痛诏，倾听独何心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34034,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寇燬中都二首 其二","author":"区怀瑞","text":"举世忧江左，无人念故丰。\n近畿蛇豕突，大地鬼神恫。\n火浣龙衣在，云栖藻井空。\n徒闻饬原庙，月出上皇宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34035,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"祥日忆亡儿宇瞻二首 其一","author":"区怀瑞","text":"三年眠食废，此日倍沾裳。\n骨肉归黄土，音容忆异乡。\n吾孙方夺抱，汝弟早中殇。\n世眼惊鲛泪，诗名惜雁行。\n人琴徒扰扰，仙籍竟茫茫。\n何限成亏事，悲歌任老狂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34036,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"祥日忆亡儿宇瞻二首 其二","author":"区怀瑞","text":"别离无不可，于尔更何心。\n既悔身前幻，翻劳世外寻。\n风泠花蝶舞，月皎峭猿吟。\n积想衡阳远，衔哀梦泽深。\n香随脉望影，光返烛龙阴。\n莫为玄成业，情痴自古今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34037,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病苏赠薛医","author":"区怀瑞","text":"岂合钧天醉帝乡，独醒端为礼医王。\n更怜小邑凋残甚，乞与大间肘后方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34038,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病起种竹四首 其一","author":"区怀瑞","text":"强起亦何事，开轩冰署西。\n花时红雨过，竹日翠云低。\n砌忆龙孙迸，檐将凤尾齐。\n无因照藜火，待汝入青溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34039,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病起种竹四首 其二","author":"区怀瑞","text":"案牍销尘海，此君方外期。\n树人无剪伐，退食伴委蛇。\n密箨云中见，疏篁雨后宜。\n千年字不灭，只有汗青知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34040,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病起种竹四首 其三","author":"区怀瑞","text":"相忆报平安，何如径里看。\n思浮金沆瀣，且卧碧琅玕。\n濯粉将风笑，捎烟及夏寒。\n预愁东海客，点简为渔竿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34041,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病起种竹四首 其四","author":"区怀瑞","text":"岂有灵妃过，将无蒋诩同。\n数枝湘水北，三径峡云东。\n花事檀栾外，桐声律吕中。\n吟篁非仿吏，畚锸自田翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34042,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"瓦镫","author":"区怀瑞","text":"薪穷兰麝后，焰劫几销沉。\n得借此陶力，应知不昧心。\n光舍一珠藏，烟袅九龙阴。\n若并铜荷影，终怜古翠侵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34043,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过玄穆衲子方丈","author":"区怀瑞","text":"野云横锡遍，还定玉山隅。\n鹫影落敷坐，龙光生念珠。\n藓披松十径，香引竹间厨。\n今日攒眉令，应无世法拘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34044,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病起偶述四首 其一","author":"区怀瑞","text":"微名恰好误游缰，才向云山枉断肠。\n岛客有心麻几折，闺人无寝草空黄。\n摄生卢扁方书杂，化国羲和岁月忙。\n时倚北窗销案牍，政成终愧酒人狂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34045,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病起偶述四首 其二","author":"区怀瑞","text":"鞴炭阴阳铸汝身，可堪蒲柳望秋尘。\n一官欲拟登楼赋，五十空劳越陌人。\n故国黄花谁送目，近边赤羽总伤神。\n衰颜若驻青铜影，不待严霜鬓已新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34046,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病起偶述四首 其三","author":"区怀瑞","text":"荀令于人别有香，休誇鸡舌侍中郎。\n赋成泽国夫容色，书报江南橘柚黄。\n紫盖辗春双白鹿，青溪捋雨几仙羊。\n似逢山鬼揶揄甚，转觉云阊道路长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34047,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病起偶述四首 其四","author":"区怀瑞","text":"七窍空明古洞天，琅环更作簿书缘。\n偶寻郢客滋兰畹，不问陶家种秫田。\n照国夜珠终自媚，嚇人腐鼠岂堪怜。\n莞然鼓枻者谁子，愧杀端溪罨画船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34048,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沮上吟四首 其一","author":"区怀瑞","text":"九子山中鸠乱啼，合溶镇上马频嘶。\n霪霖十日沮漳泛，时有衙官来护堤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34049,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沮上吟四首 其二","author":"区怀瑞","text":"东市缲丝何太忙，西河蚕熟喜颠狂。\n年来逋负门摊税，巳逼徵输过麦黄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34050,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沮上吟四首 其三","author":"区怀瑞","text":"玑组玄纁久寂寥，不知何事贡花猫。\n敝裘晏子无人问，惟向辽东觅紫貂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34051,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沮上吟四首 其四","author":"区怀瑞","text":"紫陵亭榭已千年，圣水笙箫亦悄然。\n见说霞香三百里，只知天上葬神仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34052,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"合溶镇即事","author":"区怀瑞","text":"合溶十里旧桑麻，燕子春来不见家。\n今日隔江兵火尽，更从何处访桃花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34053,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜宴光泽王府中","author":"区怀瑞","text":"手披银汉浣秋光，谩说天家岁月长。\n湘浦几年思帝子，方城今日见贤王。\n高台猎火云中映，东壁图书酉穴藏。\n王榻每咨湖海士，不堪樽俎接清狂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34054,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孙子啬中丞招集","author":"区怀瑞","text":"策府勋名逊不居，暂于花鸟待朋车。\n竹林且发阮公啸，濠上兼忘惠子书。\n绝塞岂烦催玉虎，故园频见解金鱼。\n忧时久陨疮痍泪，得听流云乐有馀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34055,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落帽亭金朋玉熊渭叟话别","author":"区怀瑞","text":"潭色净蒹葭，流云冷亭榭。\n九关虎豹秋，三峡鱼龙夜。\n渚宫盛禾黍，海匮阴桑柘。\n云中烽燧惊，埤上戈矛暇。\n千秋此落帽，八月先停驾。\n虚名抚今昔，朋酒空悲诧。\n晷刻见风期，肝胆争倾泻。\n驰驱各自奋，撰述宁相亚。\n君为息壤留，我返堆蓝下。\n何以赠素心，名山双不借。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34056,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"息壤祠","author":"区怀瑞","text":"宛忆星宫在紫微，玉苔霞駮六铢衣。\n何人盗与湮洪水，锁着空亭不放飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34057,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"章台寺","author":"区怀瑞","text":"髣髴雕阑百宝花，老僧犹自拂袈裟。\n三休玉磩今何许，飞落宫前一片霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34058,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"呼鹰台","author":"区怀瑞","text":"戚柲何须剥大圭，雪中摩厉远提携。\n招祈诗罢无人和，日暮呼鹰梦泽西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34059,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沙头杂咏六首 其一","author":"区怀瑞","text":"昨夜瞿塘下，轻舟但信风。\n晓云吹不散，飞入楚王宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34060,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沙头杂咏六首 其二","author":"区怀瑞","text":"沙寂扃歌榭，云寒掠伎衣。\n寇兵日来往，商舶尽惊飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34061,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沙头杂咏六首 其三","author":"区怀瑞","text":"百里漾一碧，章华烟未销。\n映帘千万户，无复楚宫腰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34062,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沙头杂咏六首 其四","author":"区怀瑞","text":"水落星滩口，风恬滟滪堆。\n乘槎皆估客，应载蜀山回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34063,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沙头杂咏六首 其五","author":"区怀瑞","text":"西望蚕丛路，烟霏昼不分。\n帆归句亶国，惟认锦江云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34064,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沙头杂咏六首 其六","author":"区怀瑞","text":"醉杀湘酃酒，频醒虎渡茶。\n何须涉江采，并着渚宫花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34065,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉泉寺","author":"区怀瑞","text":"珠玉迸泉香，枞篁变山骨。\n乌翚云上影，龙护衣中物。\n窈杳此湫潭，直涌花宫出。\n烟岚日幻化，人天与之一。\n横锡觅津梁，金碧而丹漆。\n始知鹓鹫峰，不异蛟螭窟。\n鼎钟层古翠，未劫谁为质。\n轮外本虚空，风火皆相失。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34066,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入堆蓝山","author":"区怀瑞","text":"郁蓝何高高，乃在象罔中。\n谁堪斸天根，畛画分鸿濛。\n熹颢有所触，宛见元化通。\n兹山曰堆蓝，点染将无同。\n草木远蔽亏，駮霞为之封。\n托息素心人，尘壒安能逢。\n我来濯长缨，浣玉披遐踪。\n惝恍蓝上观，八极跨长虹。\n徒思呼吸灵，帝载终难穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34067,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寻智者洞","author":"区怀瑞","text":"蓝上一岩幽，云烟古藓秋。\n迹因龙象划，名为圣贤留。\n石乳千花迸，龛香万木稠。\n从来积劫后，剩有几冥搜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34068,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柴紫庵贻庸上人","author":"区怀瑞","text":"擘壁久禅定，不知春草黄。\n锡前断人迹，天外闻空香。\n海藏真乘少，花宫历劫忙。\n何能滞言义，于世作津梁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34069,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄玉泉大中","author":"区怀瑞","text":"历穷无尽藏，机至为心灵。\n山鬼常年护，潭龙入夜听。\n敷衣当洗钵，振锡早持瓶。\n何限西来意，莲花一瓣青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34070,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉泉寺废钟","author":"区怀瑞","text":"鱼杵了无灵，蒲牢劫几经。\n追惟忧蠡蚀，法不借龙听。\n石火流金聚，岚烟古翠青。\n何因众山响，离寂自闻惺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34071,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张云岊入堆蓝二首 其一","author":"区怀瑞","text":"副墨迥时贤，藏将阿那边。\n所搜皆十岛，入想即千年。\n木末仙人骥，峰头太乙船。\n无繇缀霞史，咫尺郁蓝天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34072,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张云岊入堆蓝二首 其二","author":"区怀瑞","text":"搴蓝成独往，疲梦一相从。\n恍是云中侣，因之谷口逢。\n双缄漳水鲤，几尺葛陂龙。\n纵觅蒲鞭暇，秋来事事慵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34073,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入度门","author":"区怀瑞","text":"灵境在虚空，精蓝非有象。\n群峭郁草木，孤峰宛相向。\n绀蛤启壁扉，青鹓矗波浪。\n晓云每四照，夕采倏万状。\n入门罢经卷，耳目得恍旷。\n叩彼天人师，三车为之障。\n白拂费言诠，反以驱尘妄。\n剖此何所归，一證雷音上。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34074,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"度门礼秀师塔","author":"区怀瑞","text":"度门竺乾西，经律森灵鹫。\n东来九万里，震旦标一秀。\n中分黄梅枝，却挂堆蓝岫。\n涧玉注远香，莲花递相覆。\n石窌久巳荒，镫幢宛然旧。\n拂拭匪在今，舍筏无先后。\n岐别极恒沙，得悟超尘漏。\n愿以此鷇音，化作千狮吼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34075,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阅玉泉志贻梁大云","author":"区怀瑞","text":"陵谷道屡迁，烟岚本无主。\n九丘禹迹书，奥杳供裒取。\n西探玄圃峦，东尽蓬莱坞。\n弱水阻且深，今已扬尘土。\n神飞脉望编，目洞嫏嬛府。\n我来牧雨工，叱驭沮漳浒。\n遘兹图典成，如听钧天谱。\n释子记事珠，居士开山斧。\n椽笔岂有灵，乃以誇簪组。\n勿使峱间人，寄佞于隆古。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34076,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访诲公吟窝","author":"区怀瑞","text":"法海归真后，谁重泛宝船。\n精灵岂长借，身世徒相捐。\n好是名俱幻，多应妙不传。\n纸窗溅墨在，惭愧觅言诠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34077,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"紫盖寺同大中玄穆","author":"区怀瑞","text":"蹑云元不易，况与岫僧期。\n绀引春光早，青归腊意迟。\n峰莲千万叶，筇竹两三枝。\n暂远微官累，飞书洞里知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34078,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"紫盖洞寻东旭不值","author":"区怀瑞","text":"十笏莲花藏，今知第几峦。\n应寻彩水去，不驻紫云端。\n绽衲馀寒蕊，翻经祇石坛。\n何当度香海，相望路漫漫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34079,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠紫盖寺衲子东旭","author":"区怀瑞","text":"竺西欲问津，暂与葛仙邻。\n施饭留青鸟，题诗赠羽人。\n道缘非有定，世法漫相亲。\n黄叶啼空止，团蕉悟未真。\n鹫峰须慧业，龙树想前身。\n莫缚绮尘□，文章是宿因。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34080,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寻灿霞观","author":"区怀瑞","text":"圆台一片绿，是否即餐霞。\n堑玉绕新砦，搴云覆几家。\n桑田无火枣，菰饭岂胡麻。\n莫忆琪林旧，空香枳壳花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34081,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"圣水寺","author":"区怀瑞","text":"凤鸾千载后，鸽影见花宫。\n岫宿云绵薄，溪回石栈通。\n金身丹碧化，肉翼梵仙同。\n自有僧祇劫，沧桑是此中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34082,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉阳观望梅花","author":"区怀瑞","text":"碾玉出新枝，璇台望更宜。\n粉飘湘竹渚，香泛木兰阰。\n雪写钿边早，风聆笛里迟。\n东皇花史在，不为仲宣知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34083,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登仲宣楼","author":"区怀瑞","text":"石削玉阳平，楼簪百堞城。\n三秋屈子地，十载仲宣名。\n水绝蛟螭斗，云翚燕雀营。\n何当此横槊，退虏更论兵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34084,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨将军忠勋祠","author":"区怀瑞","text":"水犀提一旅，气巳冠三军。\n箭落沱江月，旗摧沮上云。\n有香萦旧垒，无碧葬孤坟。\n涕泣遗黎在，犹能悉战勋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34085,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观梁云国舞刀戏赠","author":"区怀瑞","text":"金光冷庭际，电击与星驰。\n洒月花千片，淩风玉一枝。\n岂惟制猛虎，兼可驾文螭。\n佩犊今何世，章逢总未知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34086,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夕和邃上人","author":"区怀瑞","text":"流光宛如昨，已逼化工新。\n冉冉灯前梦，皇皇酒后人。\n穷于炊减玉，悲是鬓添银。\n解识无来去，何曾恼幻身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34087,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答黄逢永 其一","author":"区怀瑞","text":"王风自南穆，江汉旧仪刑。\n阳春非寡和，巴曲郢人听。\n仲宣振遗躅，玉峭作居停。\n荒台挂云巅，沮漳回孤青。\n夫君契邃初，玄籁流昭灵。\n心飞万斛泉，手摘连珠星。\n至今欬唾香，金碧镌霞扃。\n我来披荆榛，洗发空屏营。\n林低凤鷟阴，水护蛟螭腥。\n三十三洞天，组光縢山经。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34088,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答黄逢永 其二","author":"区怀瑞","text":"昔我友四方，古道交相勖。\n论撰砥世波，图书尚盈束。\n自忝兰茝亲，变化昆山玉。\n玄精觌更远，探讨日不足。\n今来宰百里，简澹惬幽独。\n惊烽避残甸，好鸟传空谷。\n公馀理林壑，无暇窥瓶粟。\n吏道一何扩，封之乃局促。\n珍重美人贻，冰心在琴筑。\n载此永德音，枫江醉酃渌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34089,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青溪龙女祠","author":"区怀瑞","text":"龙宫窅无底，泛碧此岩阿。\n羽客归金简，泉先响玉梭。\n步虚上云汉，决润到江河。\n今日雩坛吏，泠心壁下过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34090,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观老衲入龙洞挈泉","author":"区怀瑞","text":"万斛此一碧，千霏未散丝。\n寒堪袭龙睡，清似畏人知。\n滴雾鬣先湿，护泉角正觺。\n老僧何咒力，收拾上军持。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34091,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月夜青溪寺","author":"区怀瑞","text":"枞色暝山寺，溪空月更青。\n鸟飞息僧梵，人语隔龙扃。\n灯影花千叶，冰心水一瓶。\n夕禅元不昧，乞典法王灵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34092,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]